    "authorization": "The harness independently authorizes purpose-a for the named output versions only; purpose-b has no authorization. Profile validity and graph readiness never create authorization.",
    "arrays": "State arrays are sets of event aliases. Versions/current/visible aliases select the Observation in the named event. A retracted alias identifies its complete source-output Identifier and suppresses every version with that identity, not just that alias. history includes retractions; versions does not. newlyVisible is the access newly made available at this step, not an HTTP receipt code."
